<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
    <title>Decommissioned Access (404)</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" media="screen" href="/css/static.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<div class="site-wrapper">
    <div class="site-wrapper-inner">
        <div class="cover-container" role="main">
            <div class="masthead">
                <div class="inner"><img width="150" alt="Login.gov" class="masthead-brand"
                                        src="https://login.gov/assets/img/logo-white.svg"/>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="inner cover">
                <h1>Decommissioned Access</h1>
                <p>This sign in page for <%= @friendly_name %> has been decommissioned. (404)</p>
                <% if @return_to_sp_url.present? %>
                    <p>Please visit <%= link_to @friendly_name, @return_to_sp_url, target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' %> and navigate to the button to sign in with Login.gov. If this resolves the issue, ensure that you update your bookmarks.</p>
                <% else %>
                    <p>Please return to your service provider&rsquo;s homepage and navigate to the button to sign in with Login.gov. If this resolves the issue, ensure that you update your bookmarks.</p>
                <% end %>
                <p>If the issue persists, please contact <%= @friendly_name %> and share this error page. The issue will not be resolved until they update their configuration with us.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
